{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Install the bundled ","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-patterns.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppAction"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}]},{"text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Installing-the-skill","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Requires ","type":"text"},{"code":"gh","type":"code